{% comment %}
  Shopco - self-hosted display and body typefaces.

  The reference design uses Integral CF (display/headings) and Satoshi (body).

  IMPORTANT - licensing: the committed Integral CF file is the Fontspring DEMO
  release, which is licensed for evaluation and static mockups only. It must be
  replaced with a purchased licence before this theme goes to a live store. The
  demo also ships a reduced glyph set, which is safe here only because every
  element using the display face is uppercase.

  Files live in the theme `assets/` folder:

    integral-cf-bold.otf   (display, 700)
    satoshi-regular.woff   (body, 400)
    satoshi-medium.woff    (body, 500)
    satoshi-bold.woff      (body, 700)

  If a file is ever missing, the @font-face rule simply fails to resolve and the
  fallback stacks in `shopco.css` take over, so the theme stays usable.
{% endcomment %}

{% comment %}
  Raw link tags rather than `preload_tag`: font preloads must carry `crossorigin`
  or the browser fetches the file twice, and `preload_tag` cannot emit it. This is
  the same trade-off Dawn makes in layout/theme.liquid.
{% endcomment %}
{% comment %}theme-check-disable AssetPreload{% endcomment %}
<link
  rel="preload"
  as="font"
  href="{{ 'integral-cf-bold.otf' | asset_url }}"
  type="font/otf"
  crossorigin
>
<link
  rel="preload"
  as="font"
  href="{{ 'satoshi-regular.woff' | asset_url }}"
  type="font/woff"
  crossorigin
>
{% comment %}theme-check-enable AssetPreload{% endcomment %}

{%- style -%}
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Integral CF';
    src: url('{{ 'integral-cf-bold.otf' | asset_url }}') format('opentype');
    font-weight: 700;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: swap;
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Satoshi';
    src: url('{{ 'satoshi-regular.woff' | asset_url }}') format('woff');
    font-weight: 400;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: swap;
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Satoshi';
    src: url('{{ 'satoshi-medium.woff' | asset_url }}') format('woff');
    font-weight: 500;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: swap;
  }

  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Satoshi';
    src: url('{{ 'satoshi-bold.woff' | asset_url }}') format('woff');
    font-weight: 700;
    font-style: normal;
    font-display: swap;
  }
{%- endstyle -%}
